    "基本の発見・招待・1対1チャットは無料のまま。Plusではイベントや場づくりに便利なプロフィール機能を解放します。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Discovering people, inviting, and 1:1 chat stay free. Plus unlocks profile features that help at events and meetups."
